strong>Soto</strong>: a meddlesome, yet honest boy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If you're going to do it, I'll be there to back you up.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specter</strong>: the Whimsical Watcher of the City </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Noises! Leave 'em to me~!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>\u2705How to Join the Community</strong><br>Be sure to join our Discord server! Just click &quot;Discord&quot; on the right side of the Steam page!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/a61d7505ae053e27a18fef6af7884aa3.avif?t=1755083467\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can exchange hints about the game, share your impressions while playing, and report any bugs you come across. Why not share your own &quot;Noise&quot; as well?<br>Let's escape from <strong>Noise Scramble City</strong> together!</p>",
    "short_description": "Type-NOISE: Shonen Shojo is a multi-ending mystery adventure game. A group of boys and girls who have lost their memories gather in a \u201cTokyo\u201d that is both familiar and unfamiliar. They must trace their lost memories to escape the bizarre labyrinths. Are they prepared to confront their \u201ctrue selves\u201d?",
